{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1510810001:0":{"text":"……外から声が聞こえる。","source_cn":"……外面有声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE714B1548D5E4D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510810002:0":{"text":"ああ、ここは歩哨所が近いからな。夜もうるさくてかなわん。","source_cn":"很正常，这里离哨卡太近，晚上睡觉都睡不安稳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A606CDF98EAC5D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510810003:0":{"text":"いや、この声は普通じゃない。","source_cn":"不，不是寻常的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2A2436DB3614CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510810004:0":{"text":"ホーリンどもが……<style=\"highlight\">隊列を組んでいる</style>！","source_cn":"那些呼临人……<style=highlight>在列队...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2E74252A5D21D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1510810004":{"text":"ホーリンどもが……<style=\"highlight\">隊列を組んでいる</style>！","source_cn":"那些呼临人……<style=highlight>在列队</style>！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2E74252A5D21D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510810005:1":{"text":"……<style=\"highlight\">風沼（かざぬま）の戦場</style>へ行きましょう。あそこは地形が平坦なので、大規模な交戦が起きるなら、きっとあの場所です。","source_cn":"……我们该去<style=highlight>风沼战场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182D697125B0DD7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510810006:0":{"text":"先ほども言ったように、狩猟神の出現は、戦局に恐るべき不確定要素をもたらすでしょう……","source_cn":"如我所言，狩猎神现世……必定会为战争带来极为可怕的变数。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16CC79F2184E593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510810007:0":{"text":"角長はここに残れ。今のお前は両方から狙われてるからな。 ","source_cn":"长角的雅库伯尔人就别去了，免得被围攻。现在你可是两方的公敌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE992F9332DBFAD9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510810008:0":{"text":"なっ……！","source_cn":"你……！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x108BAE6D781DEAA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510810009:1":{"text":"ネフィルさん、あなたはここでガーラさんを守ってください。","source_cn":"加拉尚需看护，那非，请照看好你的同族。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD98BA5D261805D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:13::0":{"text":"伝達石","source_cn":"传讯石","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B8E337414F1DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510810010:0":{"text":"これは<style=\"highlight\">伝達石</style>です。何かあったらいつでも連絡してください。","source_cn":"请收下这块<style=highlight>传讯石</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52996572748FF8CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510810011:0":{"text":"それから、もし<style=\"highlight\">テーブルのクリスタル</style>に変化が起きたら、すぐ私に教えてください。","source_cn":"以及，麻烦你多加留意<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF3E9B60C0BF2D3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510810012:0":{"text":"変化って、どんな？","source_cn":"会有什么变化？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D053256499E41F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510810013:1":{"text":"その時になれば分かります。このクリスタルは、広範囲の魔力の流れを感知できるのです。","source_cn":"它能识别大范围的魔力流动，若变化之刻来临，你必会知晓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFA3E6ECEEC7EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510810014:0":{"text":"ちっ……分かった。","source_cn":"啧……知道了。","status"